  "description": "The Teammachine R 01 TWO exists for one reason: pure speed. The fastest road bike to come out of BMC to date, it was developed alongside Red Bull Advanced Technology to deliver all-round race performance across every terrain and format, with aerodynamics and handling tuned for competition at the highest level of cycling.\nOur 01 Premium Carbon layup keeps this frameset exceptionally light and brutally efficient, with stiffness exactly where a racer needs it. The Shimano Dura-Ace Di2 groupset with 4iiii power meter gives precise shifting, braking, and real-time performance insight. The low-stack ICS Aero Gen 2 cockpit forms a system that’s optimized to hold speed deep into the red. All rolling on our rapid CR 50 SL Carbon tubeless-ready wheels.\nUp front, the wide-stance fork controls airflow and stabilizes the bike at speed, delivering the same unmistakable advantage found across the Teammachine R platform.",
